\r\n\r\nThe tree root Node doesn't always update correctly. Ex: Showing Editor and hiding built-in doesn't disable it, and then re-showing built-in disables it.\r\n\r\nI think it is strange to not be able to instantiate classes that can be. It makes sense to dim them and not show them if not needed, but it should still be possible to create them if selected.\r\nThe Search Help window filter works like this for opening documentation too.\r\n\r\nIf you set a type filter and later forget about it, it could be hard to tell that it is set differently until you open the popup to check. \r\nMaybe we could have a reset button next to the filters that appears when the filters aren't the default?\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111518#pullrequestreview-3436203607","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111518","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","submitted_at":"2025-11-07T21:58:28Z"},{"id":3505356281,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7Q7335","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111518#pullrequestreview-3505356281","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111518","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-11-25T14:31:10Z"},{"id":3970078168,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc7sopXY","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=